{"id":"e88f14e27e51fd2e","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-constant.md","title":"Constant","display":"df-constant — Constant","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-constant","aliases":["58-df-constant","Constant"],"display":"df-constant — Constant","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-constant"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-constant</span><span>Constant</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-constant — Constant"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,c,f\\in V\">\\(X,Y,c,f\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Constant}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Constant}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Y\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land c\\in Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;f(x)=c)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Y\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land c\\in Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;f(x)=c)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant\\text{-}existential} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Constant}_S(f,X) \\leftrightarrow \\exists c\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant\\text{-}existential} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Constant}_S(f,X) \\leftrightarrow \\exists c\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant\\text{-}equal\\text{-}values} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c) \\to \\forall x_1\\in X\\,\\forall x_2\\in X\\;(f(x_1)=f(x_2))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant\\text{-}equal\\text{-}values} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c) \\to \\forall x_1\\in X\\,\\forall x_2\\in X\\;(f(x_1)=f(x_2))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Constant: same value at every input point</li>\n<li>Zero function: constant with value 0</li>\n<li>Indicator function: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{1}_A(x) = 1\">\\(\\mathbf{1}_A(x) = 1\\)</span> if <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x \\in A\">\\(x \\in A\\)</span>, else 0</li>\n<li>Constant path: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(t) = x_0\">\\(c(t) = x_0\\)</span> for all <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\">\\(t\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Rudin, Principles of Mathematical Analysis</li>\n<li>Munkres, Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y,c,f\\in V$ and $\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,c,f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Constant}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c) \\leftrightarrow\n\\exists Y\\in V\\;(\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land c\\in Y\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;f(x)=c)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant\\text{-}existential} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Constant}_S(f,X) \\leftrightarrow \\exists c\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}constant\\text{-}equal\\text{-}values} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S(f,X,c) \\to \\forall x_1\\in X\\,\\forall x_2\\in X\\;(f(x_1)=f(x_2))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{1}_A(x) = 1","display":false},{"tex":"x \\in A","display":false},{"tex":"c(t) = x_0","display":false},{"tex":"t","display":false}],"bytes":1209,"backlinks":[{"id":"b4f98ecd268d0aa3","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Constant}_S\\subseteq V^2,\\quad \\mathrm{Injective}\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[./58-df-constant.md]], [[../batch15/58-df-injective.md]])"},{"id":"20b47403d01d8957","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ConstantValue}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (定值常函数谓词, see [[58-df-constant]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-249","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-constant]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-354","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-constant.md|58-df-constant]]（batch14）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751"]}